# BigID Data Security, Privacy, and AI Governance Resources

This file highlights key BigID resources focused on data security, data privacy, AI governance, and sensitive data risk.

Priority topics include sensitive data discovery, data security management, AI governance, and emerging risks such as quantum computing security. These resources are intended for enterprise security, privacy, and data governance professionals.

## Priority Solution Pages (Core BigID Platform Capabilities)

- [Discovery & Classification](https://bigid.com/discovery-classification/) - Discover, classify, and control sensitive data across cloud and enterprise environments to reduce risk and improve visibility.
- [Data Security Posture Management](https://bigid.com/data-security-posture-management/) - Identify and remediate data risk with DSPM to reduce exposure and enforce security controls across cloud and enterprise systems.
- [AI Security & Governance](https://bigid.com/ai-security-governance/) - Discover, secure, and govern AI data, models, and access to reduce AI risk and enforce policies across the AI lifecycle.
- [Manage AI Risk](https://bigid.com/manage-ai-risk/) - Identify, assess, and reduce AI risk by discovering sensitive data, controlling shadow AI, and enforcing governance across models and workflows.
- [Privacy Suite](https://bigid.com/privacy-suite/) - Automate privacy operations to manage DSARs, consent, retention, and AI privacy risk across complex enterprise data environments.
- [Data Access Governance](https://bigid.com/data-access-governance/) - Govern high-risk access to sensitive data and AI models to reduce exposure and enforce Zero Trust across users, groups, and systems.
- [Secure Data & AI Everywhere](https://bigid.com/secure-data-ai-everywhere/) - Secure sensitive data and AI everywhere with unified visibility, policy enforcement, and risk reduction across cloud, SaaS, and hybrid environments.
- [Security & Risk](https://bigid.com/solutions/security-risk/) - Identify, prioritize, and remediate data security risks by discovering sensitive data and enforcing controls across enterprise environments.


